---
// CTA / Contact — Section 6 of homepage
---

<section id="contact" class="py-24 md:py-32">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="rounded-3xl bg-surface px-8 py-16 text-center sm:px-12 md:px-24 md:py-24">

      <h2 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-fg sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl">
        Got a product challenge<br class="hidden md:block" />
        worth solving?
      </h2>

      <p class="mx-auto mb-10 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-muted sm:text-lg">
        I work with a small number of teams at a time — so every engagement gets
        my full thinking, not just my spare hours. If you're building something
        that matters, let's talk.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:justify-center">
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-accent px-7 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-all duration-200 hover:opacity-90"
        >
          Start a conversation
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-0.5">→</span>
        </a>
        <a
          href="mailto:hello@herruadi.com"
          class="text-sm font-medium text-muted transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-fg"
        >
          hello@herruadi.com
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
